{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 状态与资源归属\nSlot／BossState持久保存ASC；AbilitySet持有本次授予句柄。\nInput持有原生来源，Hero持有Action绑定与当前请求；ASC的输入缓冲持有原请求、held/queued、有限重试许可/等待；ASC持有组准入。\n绑定由Host编排、原生Init/ClearActorInfo执行；ASC不保存绑定事务或发布记录。\nGA持有当前激活身份与招式资源；外部等待订阅原生OnAbilityEnded，GAS负责执行。\nTask持原Playback／Guard、订阅、scale和Ticket；Animation管姿态，CMC唯一执行胶囊XYZ。\nCombat的Owned Window负责查询/去重；GA／GE／Execution／AttributeSet结算伤害。\n换人时Squad只经GA决定与原终止入口、ASC补发释放；不写能力状态。\n[[GGYGO_结构_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段结构]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#原请求终止|激活与结束接口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4exec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜Avatar绑定\nInitAbilityActorInfo(Owner, Avatar)：绑定端点输入→更新ActorInfo；端点变化使输入失效，新Pawn Avatar关联能力实例通知与OnSpawn激活。\nClearActorInfo：清除输入与原生ActorInfo。\nHost拥有绑定事务，ASC的ActorInfo持有Owner／Avatar，PawnExtension发布Ready／Released。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Avatar 绑定|绑定]] · [[Combatants/结构|Host]]",
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 730,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -560,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Input／Hero\nInput持原生来源；Hero持NativeSession、Action首观察、原ID/deadline及自身H关联。\nHero调用Receive／EndAbilityInputRequest；ASC独占held/queued、有限重试许可和等待。\nExtension Closing只退原H关联；绑定/IMC与首观察归NativeSession。\nPostProcessInput提供唯一ProcessAbilityInput帧入口。\n[[Input/结构|Input接口]]",
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4",
      "x": -1260,
      "y": 65,
      "width": 580
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 持久状态宿主\nSlot／BossState持有ASC；Host拥有Avatar选择与绑定事务，通过`InitAbilityActorInfo(宿主, Pawn)`设置ASC的Owner／Avatar关系。\nPawnExtension以本地订阅发布Ready/Released；Health／Hero／CMC／LocomotionFX各自订阅。\n换人不重绑，见[[Teams/结构#换人：留场、退场与进场|Teams]]。\n[[Combatants/结构|Host接口]]",
      "color": "4",
      "x": -1440,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜结构图\nASC持有公开输入入口（委托输入缓冲与分段输入路由）、组准入、Tag关系与Montage播放入口；GA持有当前激活身份、相机接管与招式资源；Task持有自身播放与订阅。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|执行流程]] · [[GGYGO_结构_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段结构]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#原请求终止|激活与结束接口]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|激活与结束流程]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害流程]] · [[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|命中反馈]]",
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "6",
      "x": -800,
      "y": -880
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\nReceive／End／EndFromSource／ProcessAbilityInput／ClearAbilityInput：公开入口，委托输入缓冲。\nNotifyAbilityFailed（final）委托输入缓冲认领失败来源、登记真实Queued或SwitchReturnPending许可，并提供原生失败反馈；OnAbilityInputRetryable是观察接口。\nIsActivationBlockedByGroup提供准入查询；FinalizeAbilityGroupAdmission执行终检，ActiveAbilitiesByGroup是权威组登记。\nNotifyAbilityActivated／Ended：签发与退役GA激活身份，维护组登记。\nReleaseHeldInputForControlLoss：换出时补发真实释放。\nClientCorrectAbilityState只路由纠正；绑定只经原生Init／ClearActorInfo。",
      "width": 490,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -50
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySet\n配置：需要授予的AttributeSet、GA、GE及等级。\nGiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)：配置与原ASC/Source → 授予资源，输出GrantedHandles。\nFGGYGOAbilitySet_GrantedHandles持有该来源的授予句柄；TakeFromAbilitySystem(ASC)只收回匹配句柄的资源。",
      "width": 490,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 850
    },
    {
      "id": "effect",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 伤害／表现接口\nComboStep持Damage／DamageMultiplier／PoiseDamage；GE的PassedInTags选择绝对输入或攻击力×倍率。\nBuildHitEffectPayload提供独立命中Spec；Spec持有创建时的Source属性快照，包含生效Buff。\nEffectContext持HitResult与显式Origin；Duplicate保留Origin。\nExecution消费独立削韧与衰减，写元属性；HealthSet结算。\nCueManager分发，HitImpact解析与播放反馈。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#伤害输入、Spec与属性边界|伤害契约]] · [[AbilitySystem/Cues/结构|Cue接口]]",
      "width": 490,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1",
      "x": -245,
      "y": 1150
    },
    {
      "id": "attr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HealthSet / CombatSet\nHealthSet管生命/韧性、元属性与边界。\n有限Base为内部量；Current在0～Max。\nCurrent目标/Base提交/Post事实归HealthSet。\nCombatSet提供伤害/治疗/削韧捕获输入。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|Current结算]]",
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1210,
      "width": 660
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 仲裁配置\n`UGGYGOAbilityGroupConfig`：GroupTag → 共存/独占/排队规则。\n`UGGYGOAbilityTagRelationshipMapping`：能力 Tag → 额外要求/阻断/取消 Tag。\n两者由 PawnData 注入 ASC。",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 840,
      "y": -108
    },
    {
      "id": "attribute-current-base-calculation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GGYGOAttributeBase｜Current → Base计算\nCalculateBaseForCurrent(ASC, ExpectedAttributeSet, Attribute, ExpectedCurrent, DesiredCurrent)\n输入：ASC、原Set、注册FGameplayAttributeData属性、实际Current和目标Current；游戏线程／权威端。\n输出FGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationResult；不写属性或决定业务边界。\nGGYGOAttributeBase负责ASC公开capture、默认/CustomQualifies资格查询，以及原Set/ASC/Owner/Base/Current/资格认证。\nGGYGOAttributeCalculation处理已认证栈值；原生临时通道不持GE或依赖，不要求持久属性Avatar Ready。\nHealthSet唯一拥有Current目标、边界、Base提交与OwnPost结果。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Current 与 Base 数值接口|输入、输出与职责]]",
      "width": 660,
      "height": 600,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 1210
    },
    {
      "id": "attribute-base-calculation-result",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationResult\nOutcome／Reason／CalculatedBase是本次计算返回值，不持有属性或聚合器。\nReady＋None：只有有限Base候选；实际写入与OwnPost确认归HealthSet。\nRejected：无效依赖、不可逆通道、非法Divisor、非有限值或正向不匹配。\nStale：SourceChanged／AggregationChanged；原来源或聚合已经变化。\n失败值不作候选，不授权补偿、旁写Current或保存后重试。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|HealthSet消费者]]",
      "width": 660,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2040,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-task-resource-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent\n持有原Ability／ActorInfo／ASC／Mesh／Anim来源与Montage唯一Slot，消费ASC单一Playback／Guard。\nRegisterNativeCallbacks在Ready前接受一次非空回调包，返回精确token；包含五普通回调、SectionReceived、NotifyReceived和OnFailed。\nTryGetOriginalSectionSnapshot输出原ID／Section／Position／Rate；作者点接口见下方。\nGA拥有原Activation、段资源及打断许可；Task事实不授工作权。\nAcquireActionPoseContract返回ExplicitNotRequired或RequiredReady及原Ticket；Required模式使用引擎TickTask只读Poll。\nOnFailed携Montage／Slot／Stage／Diagnostic和原InstanceID，是自身清理后的失败事实。\nTask管理自身监听、实例委托、缩放和Ticket；按原Guard／ID释放资源，不从当前Avatar认领后继。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Task原实例与资源消费|接口与资源]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态接口]] · [[GGYGO_结构_玩家普攻连段.canvas|GA资源]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 3780,
      "y": 540,
      "height": 340
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜能力Montage播放入口\nPlayAbilityMontage(GA,Activation,Montage,Rate,Section,Start,Query) → Playback／Guard结果／Duration；只支持Guard AnimInstance，失败不回退原生播放。\n原生PlayMontage覆盖转到它。\nIsPlaybackCurrent(Playback)：Local当前播放仍是同一能力、Montage、PlayInstanceId与AnimInstance，且能力仍处于记录的激活。\nClearPlayback(Playback)：仍为当前时清AnimatingAbility与GA CurrentMontage，不停止Montage。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属|接口]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|播放流程]]",
      "width": 820,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": -313,
      "height": 318
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-values",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 播放身份与Animation接缝\nFGGYGOAbilityMontagePlayback：Guard实例＋Local PlayInstanceId＋所属激活；Avatar更换后PlayInstanceId从头计数，所以另核AnimInstance。\nResult携Guard结果（Outcome／NativeStage／Identity）与Duration；失败时Playback为空。\nAnimation Guard提供生命周期与非复用CallId／CreatedInstanceId；Task只持原资源。\n[[Animation/结构|Guard接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属|播放接口]]",
      "color": "4",
      "x": 2530,
      "y": -860,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 235
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\nCan／Activate／End为final；CanActivateAbilityAdditional追加业务准入；ReturnPending期间拒绝输入发起的Try。\nCaptureCurrentActivation／IsActivationCurrent：当前激活身份（PreActivate签发、原生结束广播前退役）。\nInitializeAbilityActivation提供激活初始化；ActivateAbilityBody承接招式业务。\nRequestAbilityEnd／Cancel(Original) → Accepted／NotCurrent／NotCancelable；ScopeLock内延后并重核。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination在原生End前归还本次资源（含相机接管）。\nOnAvatarSwitchOut／NotifyOwnerControlLost／Regained：换人决定与控制通知。\nBuildHitEffectPayload提供Context／可选Spec／Cue输入，必需Spec无效明确失败。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#激活薄hook与OnSpawn受控入口|扩展点]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|生命周期]]",
      "width": 440,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 770,
      "y": 600
    },
    {
      "id": "ability-input-original-resource-values",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 660,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 原输入接口／普通值\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRequestIdentity：原weak ASC＋InputRevision＋非零RequestSerial；rev0合法。\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRetryRequest：InputTag＋Identity＋原World有限绝对OriginalDeadline；默认-1无效。\nReceiveAbilityInputRequest(Tag,PreviousID,Deadline)：空ID签原请求；非空复核原资源，冻结首次Spec集合、截止与来源会话。\nEndAbilityInputRequest(ID,Kind)：Released按最后held发释放并保留有限tap；Invalidated精确退休，不伪Released。\nEndAbilityInputRequestsFromSource：Hero会话退役时按来源一次结束。\nRequestRecord持RetryableSpecHandles及QueuedWaitOrder，PendingRetries由唯一Process消费；OnAbilityInputRetryable与OnAbilityGroupFreed仅为观察端口。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源|接口契约]]",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": -80,
      "height": 460
    },
    {
      "id": "w0-original-input-subscription",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilityTask_WaitComboInput\n持有原弱 ASC／Ability、Spec／PredictionKey、Activation 与自身订阅；GA 拥有段序和许可。\nWaitComboInput(Ability,InitialRoute) → 未 Ready Task；SetSourceStep → 来源段。\nRegisterNativeCallback(owned 请求,InitialUnavailable) → 原注册 token；注销只匹配原 token。\nSubmitEntryFact(Request,Fact) → 认证并运输真实段首。\n本地订阅 InputPressed；远端订阅强类型 TargetData／Cancelled。首次 Initial 验收后不再等待必需远端数据。\nOnDestroy 归还自身订阅和回调，不消费后继。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原事件桶与输入Task订阅|接口与清理]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 640,
      "height": 325
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-native-notify-interface",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一Montage Task的作者点接口\nResolveOriginalMontageNotifyDeclaration：资产／名字→唯一stock点的作者位置／offset／trigger，校验原链接及BranchingPoint。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify／Notifies：Ready前一次配置单点或非空异名集合；逐点合法才提交。\nTryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshotByName：名字→原固定实例的对应声明及实际位置；无名入口仅单点。\nNotifyReceived：认证原播放后给GA事实；原自然混出实例仍可交付。\nTask持声明与自身订阅，GA解释业务许可；OnDestroy精确移除原监听。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|接口与资源]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 3840,
      "y": 1320,
      "height": 380
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-native-notify-fact",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOMontageNotifyFact\nMontage／Mesh／int32 MontageInstanceId／NotifyName。\nNotifyAuthoredPositionSeconds／NotifyTriggerTimeOffsetSeconds／NotifyPositionSeconds分别为作者位置／offset／实际trigger。\n原Task按配置点认证，快照另给原实例实际位置。\n事实来源是原Task／Guard／ActorInfo及该名字声明，不签业务许可。\nGA持独立攻击／移动门，按原Activation／StepToken／Task来源消费。\n[[GGYGO_结构_玩家普攻连段.canvas|GA消费者]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|接口契约]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 3840,
      "y": 1940,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "actor-info-source-value",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1670,
      "y": 2470,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## ASC私有协作者\nFGGYGOAbilityInputBuffer：请求、按住聚合、有序边沿、组排队／SwitchReturnPending重试许可、每帧消费、ReleaseHeldInputForControlLoss。\nFGGYGOAbilityStepInputRouter：分段输入来源认证、Initial运输、TargetData RPC经ASC转原生实现。\n两者由ASC以TUniquePtr独占，普通C++对象，只在ASC调用时执行，无Tick。\nInputBuffer 的输入尝试来源与 Can 层级随同步调用栈存活。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源|输入契约]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "attribute-calculation-stateless",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 2260,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 680,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## GGYGOAttributeCalculation｜无状态计算\nHasSameAttributeAggregation(First,Second)：冻结聚合快照→修饰项/资格是否一致。\nPrepareNativeAttributeCalculationChannels(Snapshot,Parameters,OutChannels,OutOrder)：已认证快照→原生临时通道/顺序或明确Reason。\nIsAttributeForwardValueConfirmed(Actual,Desired)：有限正向值/目标→是否匹配。\nGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationTypes提供Outcome/Reason/CalculatedBase普通结果。\n仅消费本次栈值，不读当前ASC/Set、不持GE/依赖/缓存；native capture、资格外调及来源认证归ASC。\nHealthSet决定目标、提交并确认本次Post；结果不授权旁写Current或保留候选重试。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Current 与 Base 数值接口|职责与输出]]"
    }
  ],
